    {
      "id": "claim_55045edda6a44601bb01c9040396b6a6",
      "statement": "Validation.loadConfig loads validation.yaml (via SnakeYAML) into a JsonObject; the merchants section maps each merchant ID to a profile name and profiles maps endpoint keys like get.invoices to per-profile field-regex maps, with default: general applying the general profile to unlisted merchants.",
