    {
      "id": "claim_81c6da8170184bcea6ee243856fe59fe",
      "statement": "The instrument match map in InvoiceService (instrumentMatchs) resolves payment method codes (VC, MC, JC, AE, CUP, MOMO, ZALOPAY, VIETTELPAY, etc.) and NAPAS BIN prefixes (e.g. 9704001, 970403, 9704051) into type;swift_code;brand; instrument patterns, distinguishing card (OnePAY rail), np_card (NAPAS rail), ewallet, and bank-account instrument types.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/wsp/resources/invoice/InvoiceService.java#L48-L132",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:054b6935642c1bdc059dc922e4559a91ec31a554c8c5fb653675ae84f0756747:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2807afdbcfff487897189bed852c6c5e",
      "statement": "InvoiceServiceAPIs.processWithCardList filters the invoice's merchant accept_instruments patterns against the submitted vpc_CardList and the instrumentMatchs map; if no accepted method matches, it returns HTTP 400 with vpc_Message 'Invalid payment method', and notably only VIETQR is actually processed into a payment (other card lists get a 'Card list does not support' response).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/wsp/resources/invoice/InvoiceServiceAPIs.java#L114-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7ab67e36da4533dc78f9a77b9fc9054134ab6bebc7645aef4f33456191d15446:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0872ba1aa1fe479c991f2e3b3bce5333",
      "statement": "InstrumentService.transformOPNapas switches an instrument between card and np_card based on the merchant's accept_instruments pattern by appending or removing the NP suffix on the issuer Swift code, and MigrationService.tranformInstrument rewrites instrument type and Swift code via the bank_tranform rules when the merchant acceptance does not match the received Swift code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/wsp/resources/instrument/InstrumentService.java#L240-L276",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e0c3105e4d406d0993cc39ee39ed0aecc865e573322797e9a09bf510935d1016:"
