      "id": "claim_c1b9dffd92a24806877037e10f611a8d",
      "statement": "Card numbers are masked for logging and VPC responses using instrument.mask.regexp=^(\\d{6})\\d+(\\d{4})$ with replacement $1***$2, and MigrationService.sendVpcResponse additionally masks card numbers with ^(\\d{6}).+(\\d{3})$ -> $1xxx$3.",
