    {
      "id": "claim_44bf424a92104e0591dbd303f4f360e8",
      "statement": "Amount limits and special-case routing are configurable in config.properties: bigmerchant.maxamount=10000000000 and bigmerchant.minamount=1000 define big-merchant bounds, kbank.maxamount=5000000 and kbank.minamount=300000 bound OHCredit K-Bank transactions, and white-list.url.post-redirect=https://checkout.sacombank.com.vn/checkout/stbCheckout is a white-listed POST redirect target.",
