      "statement": "config.json help.swift_codes is the authoritative Swift code to bankId and BIN mapping (e.g. BFTVVNVX -> VCB 970436 bank 1, BFTVVNVXNP -> VCB-NAPAS 9704361 bank 47), alongside BIN-prefix routing entries in config.properties card-format profiles.",
